+#   CHARACTER TABULATION (U+0009), LINE FEED (LF) (U+000A), LINE
+#   TABULATION (U+000B), FORM FEED (FF) (U+000C), CARRIAGE RETURN (CR)
+#   (U+000D), and NEXT LINE (NEL) (U+0085) are mapped to SPACE (U+0020).
